            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[PiG is now its own agent next to Pi, OpenCode and Claude Code, with a PiG tab in Settings. Cards, the inspector and the terminal header say which one a task runs. Tasks that used the old Engine = PiG setting are moved to the PiG agent on first launch; sessions stay shared under ~/.pi/agent.
]]></description>
